# Runtime data — per-user state, passkeys, session secret and push keys.
# NOTE: data/ and media/ are currently still TRACKED in this fork (they were
# committed before this file existed). Ignoring them here only stops *new*
# files from being added; untracking the existing ones needs an explicit
# `git rm -r --cached data media` — and data/secret + data/vapid.json should
# be regenerated afterwards, since they are private keys.
data/
media/
